  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Let's recap the evolution.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1720,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 52,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Method one preserved everything.",
      "start_ms": 2940,
      "end_ms": 4540,
      "start_frame": 88,
      "end_frame": 136,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "We kept a full original copy, so mutation could never corrupt our source of truth.",
      "start_ms": 5180,
      "end_ms": 10600,
      "start_frame": 155,
      "end_frame": 318,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Correct?",
      "start_ms": 11160,
      "end_ms": 11600,
      "start_frame": 335,
      "end_frame": 348,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "But expensive, in memory.",
      "start_ms": 12240,
      "end_ms": 14460,
      "start_frame": 367,
      "end_frame": 434,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Method two asked a better question.",
      "start_ms": 15460,
      "end_ms": 17580,
      "start_frame": 464,
      "end_frame": 527,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "What information do we actually need?",
      "start_ms": 18340,
      "end_ms": 20540,
      "start_frame": 550,
      "end_frame": 616,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Only which rows and which columns contained an original zero.",
      "start_ms": 21060,
      "end_ms": 25180,
      "start_frame": 632,
      "end_frame": 755,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So we compress the full copy into row zero and call zero.",
      "start_ms": 25840,
      "end_ms": 30720,
      "start_frame": 775,
      "end_frame": 922,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "That reduced the extra space to O M plus N.",
      "start_ms": 31340,
      "end_ms": 35280,
      "start_frame": 940,
      "end_frame": 1058,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Then came the final observation.",
      "start_ms": 35780,
      "end_ms": 37520,
      "start_frame": 1073,
      "end_frame": 1126,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The matrix already contains one cell for every row in its first column and one cell for every column in its first row.",
      "start_ms": 38240,
      "end_ms": 47600,
      "start_frame": 1147,
      "end_frame": 1428,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "So instead of allocating marker arrays, we reuse the matrix itself.",
      "start_ms": 48060,
      "end_ms": 53040,
      "start_frame": 1442,
      "end_frame": 1591,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "But reusing storage destroys old information.",
      "start_ms": 53760,
      "end_ms": 57000,
      "start_frame": 1613,
      "end_frame": 1710,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "That is why we first saved first row zero and first call zero.",
      "start_ms": 57000,
      "end_ms": 61560,
      "start_frame": 1710,
      "end_frame": 1847,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Then the matrix became its own memory.",
      "start_ms": 62080,
      "end_ms": 64140,
      "start_frame": 1862,
      "end_frame": 1924,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "This gives us the final complexity.",
      "start_ms": 64780,
      "end_ms": 66740,
      "start_frame": 1943,
      "end_frame": 2002,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "O M times N time and O one extra space.",
      "start_ms": 67780,
      "end_ms": 71560,
      "start_frame": 2033,
      "end_frame": 2147,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Set matrix zeros is complete.",
      "start_ms": 71900,
      "end_ms": 74020,
      "start_frame": 2157,
      "end_frame": 2221,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Question 13, done.",
      "start_ms": 74660,
      "end_ms": 76260,
      "start_frame": 2240,
      "end_frame": 2288,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Our global progress is now 13 out of 227.",
      "start_ms": 77100,
      "end_ms": 81840,
      "start_frame": 2313,
      "end_frame": 2455,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "We continue the arrays and hashing roadmap with question 14.",
      "start_ms": 82080,
      "end_ms": 87900,
      "start_frame": 2462,
      "end_frame": 2637,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Rotate image.",
      "start_ms": 88920,
      "end_ms": 89860,
      "start_frame": 2668,
      "end_frame": 2696,
      "word_count": 2
    }
  ],
